    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n12 Killian's Glen is a beautifully presented A-rated, three bed semi-detached home. Ideally located in a well-regarded and modern development of just 25 units and convenient to Rathdrum Village and Railway Station.This stunning modern home offers 99.3 sq m of bright, perfectly designed accommodation, featuring three well-appointed bedrooms, including a master en-suite. The spacious open-plan living and dining area flows seamlessly into a sleek, contemporary kitchen, ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. A convenient guest wc and a beautifully finished family bathroom complete the interior. \n\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a generous lawned garden with a gravel patio area, along with the benefit of a side entrance. Finished to an exceptionally high standard throughout, this home offers modern comfort, effortless style, and superb attention to detail.\n\nWithin easy walking distance are a host of local amenities including shops, schools, medical care, and library. Rathdrum also offers plenty of sports and leisure facilities, including the ever-popular Avondale Forest Park and its award-winning Treetop Walk. Public transport options in Rathdrum include a mainline train station, with Dublin's M50 reachable in under 30 minutes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.19m x 1.83m\nA bright and inviting entrance hallway featuring wood effect ceramic tiles, a guest wc, under-stair storage and a carpeted staircase leading to the upper floor.\n\nWC/Storage - 1.43m x 1.83m\nStylish guest wc featuring a wash-hand basin and a Whirlpool washing machine, with convenient storage space above\n\nOpen Plan Living - 8.99m x 5.73m\nThis attractive open-plan layout combines a modern living area, a generous dining space and a sleek contemporary kitchen. The living room features a large window that floods the space with natural light and is centred around a built-in electric fireplace. The dining area provides a comfortable setting with ample room for a full dining suite, ideal for everyday meals or entertaining. Wood effect ceramic tile flooring runs throughout, adding a stylish finish to the room.\n\nKitchen - \nFitted with stylish floor-to-ceiling cabinetry in a modern mix of navy and grey, the kitchen features an integrated Bosch oven, Bosch induction hob, and a Caple stainless steel sink. The pantry offers excellent storage, integrated LED lighting, and a convenient appliance space with power outlets. Double doors open to the rear garden.\n\nLanding - 4.49m x 2.69m\nWith attic acces and hotpress with heat pump.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.30m x 3.71m\nThe primary bedroom is to the front of the property with views to the surrounding countryside. This bright double bedroom boasts fitted wardrobes, carpet and an ensuite.\n\nEn-suite - 2.38m x 1.92m\nSpacious ensuite with stylish tiling, corner walk in shower, wc and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.57m x 2.90m\nSpacious double bedroomn with views to the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.23m x 2.69m\nCurrently used as a dressing room with fitted wardrobes and views to the rear garden.\n\nBathroom - 1.91m x 2.52m\nWell proportioned main bathroom with stylish tiling, walk in rainfall shower, wc and bespoke wash hand basin with vanity.\n\nRear Garden - \nOff the kitchen is a low maintenance patio area with steps leading to a raised lawn.The rear garden is private and offers scope for you to create your own oasis.\n\n"
      },
